{"descriptionModels":[{"description":"Prerequisite: Dexterity 13 You are an expert in using thrown weapons. You gain the following benefits:\n\n- When you take the Attack action on your turn, you can use a bonus action to make a ranged attack with a thrown weapon.\n\n- When you make a ranged weapon attack, you can draw the weapon as part of the attack. You can draw any number of weapons in this fashion each round.\n\n- The short and long ranges of your thrown weapons double.","level":1}],"id":"Customa3985412-d094-453f-8da3-d7f684ba3549","isFeature":false,"jsonType":"feat","level":1,"name":"Expert Thrower [VSS]","notes":"","type":"Feat"}